OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment withdraws plans for
OL,4,Acity expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has withdrawn a
OL,7,Fcontroversial plan to expand
OL,8,FLeicester's political boundary.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, ministers said previous
OL,11,Fproposals to create a greater Leicester
OL,12,Fcouncil, absorbing towns and villages
OL,13,Fcurrently outside the city, would be
OL,14,Freassessed.
OL,16,FThe proposal to abolish the 10 existing
OL,17,Fcouncils in Leicester, Leicestershire
OL,18,Fand Rutland and replace them with two
OL,19,Flarger unitary authorities has been
OL,20,Ftaken off the table at this stage.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
