OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment withdraws plans for
OL,4,Acity expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal government minister Jim McMahon
OL,7,Ftold MPs a new proposal for the
OL,8,Fpolitical map of Leicestershire would
OL,9,Fbe announced either before Christmas or
OL,10,Fearly in 2027.
